Got something you want to say?

304
00:16:49,877 --> 00:16:53,777
This new era they keep rambling on and on about is a load of crap.

305
00:16:54,157 --> 00:16:57,797
The era when pirates dream of treasure will come to an end?

306
00:16:58,197 --> 00:16:59,317
Yeah, right!

307
00:16:59,317 --> 00:17:02,017
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!

308
00:17:06,157 --> 00:17:11,777
The dreams of pirates will never end!

309
00:17:13,317 --> 00:17:14,697
Am I right?

310
00:17:16,397 --> 00:17:21,137
And just like Sky Island, the One Piece is really out there.

311
00:17:21,597 --> 00:17:25,237
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!

312
00:17:25,597 --> 00:17:28,917
I can't wait for you to see what we've got in store!

313
00:17:29,317 --> 00:17:31,817
Trust me, you're going to be impressed.

314
00:17:32,397 --> 00:17:36,157
In a few hours, we're going to put on a show so explosive

315
00:17:36,157 --> 00:17:38,277
that it'll shake the whole damn world.

316
00:17:39,237 --> 00:17:40,957
Ignore him, Luffy. Come on.

317
00:17:51,477 --> 00:17:53,117
Yee-haw!

318
00:17:54,517 --> 00:17:56,217
Keep moving, boys.

319
00:17:56,497 --> 00:17:58,017
Straight to level three.

320
00:17:59,317 --> 00:18:06,517
Crap! We're dead!

321
00:18:06,697 --> 00:18:07,737
We can't defeat him!

322
00:18:07,957 --> 00:18:09,237
We're trapped on this floor!

323
00:18:14,917 --> 00:18:16,757
The further he comes down,

324
00:18:16,957 --> 00:18:18,777
the more he keeps pushing us back!

325
00:18:18,837 --> 00:18:20,497
No! We're helpless against him!

326
00:18:20,677 --> 00:18:21,457
What do we do?

327
00:18:21,877 --> 00:18:24,677
Wait, Straw Hat, you don't want to fight that beast!

328
00:18:24,677 --> 00:18:39,537
Hold on, Straw Boy! I can help!

329
00:18:39,557 --> 00:18:40,117
Back off!

330
00:18:40,517 --> 00:18:40,817
Huh?

331
00:18:41,197 --> 00:18:42,017
Just wait.

332
00:18:42,357 --> 00:18:44,597
The last thing you want to do is step in this path now.

333
00:18:44,597 --> 00:18:45,957
What's that supposed to mean?

334
00:18:46,197 --> 00:18:46,997
We're partners!

335
00:18:47,317 --> 00:18:48,277
He needs me!

336
00:18:50,677 --> 00:18:51,937
You're in my way.

337
00:18:53,797 --> 00:18:54,217
Huh?

338
00:19:05,717 --> 00:19:06,797
Straw Boy, no!

339
00:19:06,797 --> 00:19:07,597
Ah!

340
