Jack!

344
00:19:18,497 --> 00:19:19,757
Pitones!

345
00:19:20,177 --> 00:19:20,317
Err!

346
00:19:20,317 --> 00:19:30,277
I'm coming, Ace!

347
00:19:35,237 --> 00:19:36,837
Did that just happen?

348
00:19:37,157 --> 00:19:39,597
He finished off that monster with a single punch.

349
00:19:40,017 --> 00:19:42,697
I heard this guy was tough, but that's just plain crazy.

350
00:19:42,837 --> 00:19:43,857
Nice, Straw Boy.

351
00:19:44,597 --> 00:19:46,017
Okay, that's that.

352
00:19:46,657 --> 00:19:48,677
What's everyone just standing around for?

353
00:19:48,677 --> 00:19:50,477
Fuck! Let's skedaddle!

354
00:19:55,477 --> 00:19:59,317
Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh! Warden!

355
00:19:59,737 --> 00:20:04,717
Oh! Oh! Can you please get me down from here? Stop staring, you creeps! Help me!

356
00:20:04,857 --> 00:20:07,277
Calm down. Tell me what happened to you, Sadie.

357
00:20:07,517 --> 00:20:12,777
That Tammy Von Cuff beat me and tied me up! Just get me down!

358
00:20:12,997 --> 00:20:16,457
Do you know how humiliating it is to do this to a dominatrix?

359
00:20:16,457 --> 00:20:19,817
Help her, man. I don't have time to deal with this.

360
00:20:19,877 --> 00:20:21,037
Yes, sir! Right away!

361
00:20:21,037 --> 00:20:40,837
I've got a funny feeling you're Magellan.

362
00:20:40,837 --> 00:20:43,197
And I'm guessing you're Blackbeard.

363
00:20:43,797 --> 00:20:45,717
Hit the nail right on the head, pal.

364
00:20:46,137 --> 00:20:46,637
Hydra!

365
00:20:48,637 --> 00:21:06,337
I'm too busy trying to run this prison to even bother asking what you're doing here.

366
00:21:06,337 --> 00:21:14,137
Oh! Oh! What is this stuff?

367
00:21:16,137 --> 00:21:19,557
Oh! Dammit! It's gonna be some kind of poison!

368
00:21:21,257 --> 00:21:23,177
Get back here!

369
00:21:23,177 --> 00:21:30,857
Hannibal.

370
00:21:30,857 --> 00:21:30,977
Hannibal.

371
00:21:32,857 --> 00:21:35,077
I'm impressed with how long you held out.

372
00:21:36,397 --> 00:21:37,977
I'll take the rest from here.

373
00:21:39,357 --> 00:21:41,097
Is the Vice Warden all right, sir?

374
00:21:42,137 --> 00:21:43,877
Oh, no. He looks terrible.

375
00:21:44,497 --> 00:21:46,197
Quit gawking and help him out.

376
00:21:46,537 --> 00:21:47,117
Yes, sir!

377
00:21:47,117 --> 00:21:53,417
Vice Warden! Just hang in there, okay? Can you hear me, sir?

378
00:21:53,757 --> 00:21:55,277
You can't die, Hannibal.

379
00:21:56,237 --> 00:22:00,297
You're the only one who can possibly take my place.

380
00:22:00,297 --> 00:22:12,937
Straw Hat.

381
00:22:13,357 --> 00:22:16,557
How the hell could you possibly survive after I poisoned you?

382
00:22:17,577 --> 00:22:20,837
There's no doubt that he's the one who caused all this mayhem.

383
00:22:21,177 --> 00:22:24,917
The next chance I get, nothing will stop me from taking his life.

384
00:22:24,917 --> 00:22:34,037
Straw Hat!

385
00:22:38,037 --> 00:22:40,977
You hear that? Magellan's coming!

386
00:22:41,477 --> 00:22:43,157
That came from the foot of the stairs!

387
00:22:43,497 --> 00:22:45,477
We're all dead if it catches up to us!

388
00:22:46,757 --> 00:22:48,157
The poison guy!

389
00:22:48,157 --> 00:22:55,217
I promise you this, Straw Hat!

390
00:22:55,377 --> 00:22:57,437
You will never escape this prison!

391
00:22:57,437 --> 00:23:13,917
Luffy and company finally make their way through level three.

392
00:23:13,917 --> 00:23:17,677
Ivankov has Inazuma sealed the stairs to slow Magellan down

393
00:23:17,677 --> 00:23:19,957
and remains behind to face him in battle

394
00:23:19,957 --> 00:23:22,397
while the others make their escape to the top of the prison.

395
00:23:22,677 --> 00:23:27,357
However, even his new Kama Kenpo may prove no match for the Warden's deadly poison.

396
00:23:27,777 --> 00:23:30,497
On the next Wood Piece, Stop Magellan!

397
00:23:30,837 --> 00:23:33,097
Eva's esoteric technique explodes!

398
00:23:33,537 --> 00:23:35,317
I'm gonna be king of the pirates!

